        "    Executing Command line: \"C:\\Windows\\system32\\msiexec.exe\" /i \"ContosoExpenses-4.2.0.msi\" /qn /l*v C:\\Windows\\CCM\\Logs\\ContosoExpenses-install.log with system context",
